  },
  "description": "IGIZIL crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C114 H146 N4 O82 Tb14,4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb7 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb8 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb9 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb10 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb11 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb12 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors; Tb13 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb14 (Tb) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 19 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.751-4.111 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.90-113.98°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Tb14(L)2(L')2(OH)2(CO3)4(OAc)26(H2O)2] (L from H2L = N,N'-bis(3-methoxysalicylidene)pentane-1,3-diamine; L' from HL' = 3-methoxysalicylaldehyde); elemental formula C114H146N4O82Tb14. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 26 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
  "interpretation_limit": "Oxidation states, nuclearity, oxo/hydroxo bridging, core charge and ligand identities/counts require article/SI or manual verification; atom-site counts are asymmetric-unit counts, not molecular stoichiometry. Graph topology is limited to identity-symmetry bonds in the CIF table. Approximate shape is based only on bridge-unwrapped metal-site coordinates in the largest component; symmetry-related bonds or periodic structures require manual crystallographic review. Empirical formulas alone do not establish unique oxidation-state assignments or ligand connectivity; annotations above reproduce explicit structural notation only.",
